#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:4
msgid "Using elastic memory"
msgstr "弹性内存使用说明"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:6
msgid ""
"Elastic memory lets DPE retry a CPU UDF task with more memory after an out-"
"of-memory (OOM) failure. It is useful when most tasks need little memory but"
" a few process much larger inputs."
msgstr ""
"弹性内存用于处理 DPE CPU UDF "
"的内存不足（OOM）：任务失败后，可以申请更大的内存重试。它适合大多数任务用较小内存就能完成、少数任务需要处理更大输入的情况。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:11
msgid "When to use elastic memory"
msgstr "什么时候使用弹性内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:13
msgid ""
"Variable-length payloads and large groups can make memory use uneven. Giving"
" every task the largest allocation reserves extra memory for ordinary "
"inputs. With a fixed quota, this can reduce the number of tasks running at "
"once. A large memory request can also increase the CPU request to meet the "
"memory-per-CPU ratio."
msgstr ""
"变长数据和大小不一的分组，会让各个任务的内存需求差很多。如果所有任务都按最大需求分配内存，普通任务也会预留这部分资源。在固定 Quota "
"下，能同时运行的任务数可能因此减少。内存申请较大时，CPU 申请量也会按内存与 CPU 的比例限制上调。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:19
msgid ""
"Use elastic memory for occasional OOM failures. If nearly every task needs "
"more memory, raise the starting ``memory`` or reduce the input size first. "
"Reducing ``batch_rows`` lowers temporary memory per function call, but does "
"not shrink the input chunk already held by the task. See :ref:`udf_tuning`."
msgstr ""
"弹性内存适合偶发的 OOM。如果几乎每个任务都需要更多内存，应先调大起始 ``memory``，或减少输入数据量。调小 ``batch_rows`` "
"可以减少单次函数调用的临时内存，但不会缩小任务已经持有的输入 Chunk。调整方法见 :ref:`udf_tuning`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:27
msgid "Supported tasks"
msgstr "支持哪些任务"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:29
msgid ""
"The SDK and DPE runtime must support elastic memory, and the task must allow"
" retries. GU tasks, tasks with concurrency limits, and tasks scheduled "
"together through gang scheduling do not support it. It is also disabled when"
" ``options.dpe.settings[\"step.skip_task_resources\"] = True``."
msgstr ""
"SDK 和 DPE 运行环境需要支持弹性内存，任务本身也需要允许重试。GU 任务、设置了并发限制的任务，以及通过 gang scheduling "
"要求一起调度的任务，不支持弹性内存。设置 ``options.dpe.settings[\"step.skip_task_resources\"] = "
"True`` 时，也不会开启该功能。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:34
msgid ""
"Elastic memory can be used with CPU UDFs running on DPE, including the "
"following interfaces:"
msgstr "弹性内存适用于在 DPE 上用 CPU 运行的 UDF，包括以下接口："

