#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:59
msgid "Configure memory"
msgstr "配置内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:61
msgid ""
"Set the starting ``memory`` and retry limit ``memory_limit`` in the same "
"``with_running_options`` decorator. For example, this UDF expands JSON "
"arrays stored in a ``payload`` column. Longer arrays produce more rows and "
"temporary objects, so batches can need different amounts of memory."
msgstr ""
"在同一个 ``with_running_options`` 装饰器中设置起始内存 ``memory`` 和重试上限 "
"``memory_limit``。例如，下面的 UDF 将 ``payload`` 列中的 JSON "
"数组展开成表。数组越长，展开后的行数和临时对象越多，不同批次需要的内存也会不同。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:78
msgid ""
"These sizes illustrate the configuration; a short payload will not trigger "
"OOM. Size memory from representative inputs. To start at 8 GiB and allow up "
"to 32 GiB, change the decorator to ``memory=\"8GiB\", "
"memory_limit=\"32GiB\"``. Omitting ``memory`` uses the shared default, "
"initially 4 GiB."
msgstr ""
"这里的数值用于说明配置方法，较短的输入不会触发 OOM。实际取值需要根据有代表性的输入确定。如果要从 8 GiB 开始、最多增加到 32 "
"GiB，将装饰器中的参数改为 ``memory=\"8GiB\", memory_limit=\"32GiB\"``。省略 ``memory`` "
"时使用共享默认值，初始为 4 GiB。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:83
msgid ""
"``memory_limit`` must be at least ``memory``. Equal values are valid and "
"disable expansion; a smaller limit raises an error. The cluster's available "
"resources also constrain the effective limit."
msgstr "``memory_limit`` 不能小于 ``memory``。两者相等是合法配置，此时不扩容；上限更小时会报错。实际扩容还受到集群可用资源的限制。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:88
msgid "Shared defaults and per-function overrides"
msgstr "共享默认值和单个函数的配置"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:90
msgid ""
"To use the same elastic-memory settings for multiple DPE CPU UDFs, include "
"both ``memory`` and ``memory_limit`` in the shared defaults:"
msgstr "多个 DPE CPU UDF 需要使用相同的弹性内存配置时，可以在默认资源中同时设置 ``memory`` 和 ``memory_limit``："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:103
msgid ""
"Eligible DPE CPU UDF tasks then start with 4 GiB and can retry with up to 16"
" GiB. This setting does not select the execution engine. Assigning a new "
"dict replaces the previous defaults, so keep ``memory`` in the dict when "
"setting ``memory_limit``; otherwise each affected UDF must provide it in its"
" decorator."
msgstr ""
"符合条件的 DPE CPU UDF 任务会从 4 GiB 开始，重试时最多增加到 16 GiB。这个设置不会改变执行引擎。给 "
"``default_running_options`` 赋一个新字典会替换原来的默认值，因此设置 ``memory_limit`` 时要保留 "
"``memory``，或在各个 UDF 的装饰器中单独指定起始内存。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:112
msgid "Override or disable a shared memory limit"
msgstr "单个函数覆盖或关闭共用的内存上限"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:114
msgid ""
"``memory`` and ``memory_limit`` are inherited separately. With shared "
"defaults of ``memory=\"4GiB\"`` and ``memory_limit=\"16GiB\"``:"
msgstr ""
"``memory`` 和 ``memory_limit`` 分别继承默认值。假设默认设置为 "
"``memory=\"4GiB\"``、``memory_limit=\"16GiB\"``："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:117
msgid ""
"``@with_running_options(memory=\"8GiB\")`` starts at 8 GiB and keeps the 16 "
"GiB limit."
msgstr "``@with_running_options(memory=\"8GiB\")`` 从 8 GiB 开始，上限仍是 16 GiB。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:119
msgid ""
"``@with_running_options(memory=\"8GiB\", memory_limit=\"8GiB\")`` uses 8 GiB"
" without elastic-memory retries for that UDF. Ordinary retries are "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``@with_running_options(memory=\"8GiB\", memory_limit=\"8GiB\")`` 使用 8 "
"GiB，为这个 UDF 关闭弹性内存重试，普通重试不受影响。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:121
msgid ""
"``@with_running_options(memory=\"32GiB\")`` fails validation because the "
"inherited 16 GiB limit is below the new starting memory. Set a larger limit "
"in the same decorator, or set ``memory_limit=\"32GiB\"`` to disable "
"expansion."
msgstr ""
"``@with_running_options(memory=\"32GiB\")`` 会报错，因为继承的 16 GiB "
"上限小于新的起始内存。需要在同一个装饰器中调高上限，或设置 ``memory_limit=\"32GiB\"`` 关闭扩容。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:125
msgid ""
"Passing ``memory_limit=None`` leaves the shared limit in effect. To remove a"
" shared limit for subsequent expressions, remove the key before building "
"them:"
msgstr "传入 ``memory_limit=None`` 会继续沿用共用的上限。如果希望后续构建的表达式不再继承这个上限，应先从默认配置中移除该项："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:135
msgid "Configuration errors"
msgstr "配置报错时怎么处理"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:137
msgid ""
"``memory must be specified when memory_limit is set``: set the starting "
"``memory`` in the decorator or shared defaults. Replacing the defaults with "
"a dictionary containing only ``memory_limit`` removes the built-in memory."
msgstr ""
"``memory must be specified when memory_limit is set``：在装饰器或共享默认值中补上起始 "
"``memory``。如果用只包含 ``memory_limit`` 的字典替换共享默认值，原有的默认内存也会被移除。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:140
msgid ""
"``memory_limit must be greater than or equal to memory``: check the merged "
"settings. Raising ``memory`` can leave an inherited limit below it. Set a "
"supported limit at least as large as the starting memory."
msgstr ""
"``memory_limit must be greater than or equal to memory``：检查合并后的配置。单独调大 "
"``memory``，可能使继承的上限低于起始内存。应同时设置不小于起始内存、且运行环境支持的上限。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:143
msgid ""
"If a valid limit does not lead to expansion, follow "
":ref:`udf_elastic_memory_not_expanding`."
msgstr "配置合法但没有扩容时，按 :ref:`udf_elastic_memory_not_expanding` 排查。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:147
msgid "How retries work"
msgstr "开启功能后表现"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:149
msgid ""
"When DPE classifies a failure as OOM, the next attempt requests "
"``min(current_memory * 2, memory_limit)``. A task that still runs out of "
"memory at the limit fails. Other errors follow ordinary retry rules and keep"
" the current memory allocation."
msgstr ""
"DPE 将失败识别为 OOM 后，下次尝试会申请 ``min(current_memory * 2, memory_limit)`` "
"的内存。达到上限后仍然 OOM，任务就会失败。其他错误按普通重试规则处理，继续使用当前的内存分配。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:154
msgid ""
"DPE doubles memory after OOM, stops at the limit, and keeps memory for "
"ordinary retries"
msgstr "DPE 遇到 OOM 后将内存翻倍，到达上限后停止扩容；普通重试保持当前内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:154
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/elastic_memory/retry-flow.svg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/elastic_memory/retry-flow.svg\n"
"   :alt: DPE 遇到 OOM 后将内存翻倍，到达上限后停止扩容；普通重试保持当前内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:158
msgid ""
"An error such as ``ExitError: signal: killed`` is a clue, not proof by "
"itself. Correlate the failure, memory metrics, and the next attempt's "
"allocation. See :ref:`udf_faqs` for OOM diagnosis."
msgstr ""
"``ExitError: signal: killed`` 这类报错只能作为线索，不能单独证明发生了 "
"OOM。需要结合失败记录、内存指标和下一次尝试的内存分配判断，排查方法见 :ref:`udf_faqs`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:162
msgid ""
"Suppose the starting memory is 4 GiB and the limit is 16 GiB. The following "
"examples show how OOM retries and ordinary retries work together."
msgstr "假设初始内存为 4 GiB，上限为 16 GiB。下面举两个例子，看看 OOM 扩容重试和普通重试分别会怎么处理。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:166
msgid "Example 1: a network error after memory expansion"
msgstr "例一：扩容后遇到网络错误"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:168
msgid ""
"This UDF needs 16 GiB to finish. The first two attempts run out of memory. "
"The third has enough memory, but fails with a retryable network error. There"
" are still ordinary retries available, so the task is tried again."
msgstr ""
"这个 UDF 需要 16 GiB "
"内存才能跑完。前两次因为内存不足失败；第三次内存够了，却遇到一次可重试的网络错误。此时普通重试次数还未用完，因此会再试一次。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:176
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:205
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:357
msgid "Attempt"
msgstr "执行次数"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:177
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:206
msgid "Allocated memory"
msgstr "分配内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:178
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:207
msgid "Result"
msgstr "执行结果"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:179
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:208
msgid "1st"
msgstr "第 1 次"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:180
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:209
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:362
msgid "4 GiB"
msgstr "4 GiB"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:181
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:210
msgid "OOM; retry with 8 GiB."
msgstr "OOM，增加到 8 GiB 重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:182
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:211
msgid "2nd"
msgstr "第 2 次"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:183
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:212
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:366
msgid "8 GiB"
msgstr "8 GiB"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:184
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:213
msgid "OOM; retry with 16 GiB."
msgstr "OOM，增加到 16 GiB 重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:185
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:214
msgid "3rd"
msgstr "第 3 次"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:186
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:189
#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:215
msgid "16 GiB"
msgstr "16 GiB"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:187
msgid "Retryable network error; retry with the same memory."
msgstr "网络错误，保持 16 GiB 进行普通重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:188
msgid "4th"
msgstr "第 4 次"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:190
msgid "Success; the task finishes."
msgstr "执行成功，任务结束。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:192
msgid ""
"The two OOM retries do not count toward the ordinary retry limit. The "
"network error causes one ordinary retry. That retry keeps the increased "
"memory of 16 GiB: it neither falls back to 4 GiB nor increases it further."
msgstr ""
"前两次 OOM 扩容重试不占用普通重试次数，网络错误触发的重试占用一次。普通重试会保留已经加大的内存，所以第四次仍用 16 GiB，不会退回 4 "
"GiB，也不会继续增加内存。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:197
msgid "Example 2: the memory limit is still not enough"
msgstr "例二：加到上限仍然不够"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:199
msgid "This UDF needs 32 GiB to finish, but the configured limit is only 16 GiB."
msgstr "这个 UDF 需要 32 GiB 内存才能跑完，但设置的上限只有 16 GiB。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:216
msgid "OOM at the limit; the task fails."
msgstr "OOM，已经达到上限，任务失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:218
msgid ""
"The third attempt has reached the 16 GiB limit and still runs out of memory."
" The task fails instead of increasing memory to 32 GiB, even if ordinary "
"retries are still available."
msgstr "第三次已经用到 16 GiB 上限，仍然 OOM，任务就会失败，不会继续增加到 32 GiB。即使还有普通重试次数，也不会因此继续重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:222
msgid ""
"These examples assume that enough resources are available and platform "
"protection rules do not stop retries earlier. Keep ordinary retries enabled "
"to handle temporary network or disk errors."
msgstr "以上例子假设平台资源充足，也没有触发保护规则；实际运行中，重试可能因为这些限制提前停止。建议保留原来的普通重试，避免偶发的网络、磁盘错误导致整个任务失败。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:227
msgid "Resource use and repeated execution"
msgstr "资源变化和重复执行"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:229
msgid ""
"Only the failed UDF task requests more resources. With the default maximum "
"ratio of 12 GiB per CPU, a task requesting one CPU and 16 GiB or 24 GiB is "
"adjusted to two CPUs. See :ref:`udf_tuning_resources` for the calculation "
"and the separate MCSQL CU setting."
msgstr ""
"只有失败的 UDF 任务会申请更多资源。默认每个 CPU 最多对应 12 GiB 内存，因此一个申请了 1 个 CPU 的任务，使用 16 GiB 或 "
"24 GiB 内存时，CPU 会增加到 2 个。计算方式以及 MCSQL 单独的 CU 设置见 :ref:`udf_tuning_resources`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:234
msgid ""
"A retry runs the function again. File writes, appended records, and external"
" requests must tolerate repeated execution. Expansion and retries consume "
"extra time and resources; they do not fix memory leaks or arbitrarily large "
"inputs."
msgstr "重试会重新执行函数。写文件、追加记录或请求外部服务时，需要能够处理重复执行。扩容和重试会增加耗时和资源消耗，不能解决内存泄漏，也不能处理任意大的输入。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:242
msgid "Verify the retry and choose memory sizes"
msgstr "验证扩容并选择内存大小"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:244
msgid ""
"Open ``session.get_logview_address()`` and find the UDF in DPE's "
"**SubSteps** list; the navigation is described in :ref:`udf_debugging_dpe`. "
"After expansion, **Description** includes a label such as ``[2.0x memory]``."
" The label compares the new allocation with the starting memory. Check "
"**Rerun**, task status, and the failed and successful attempt records "
"together."
msgstr ""
"打开 ``session.get_logview_address()`` 返回的链接，在 DPE 的 **SubSteps** 列表中找到 "
"UDF，具体路径见 :ref:`udf_debugging_dpe`。扩容后，**Description** 中会出现 ``[2.0x "
"memory]`` 这样的标签，表示当前分配的内存是起始内存的几倍。还需要一起查看 **Rerun**、任务状态，以及失败和成功的尝试记录。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:250
msgid ""
"The ratio can be fractional: expanding from 4 GiB to a 10 GiB limit produces"
" ``[2.5x memory]``."
msgstr "倍率也可以是小数。例如，从 4 GiB 扩到 10 GiB 上限时，标签为 ``[2.5x memory]``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:254
msgid "Run a deliberate OOM example"
msgstr "运行一个故意触发 OOM 的示例"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:256
msgid ""
"The following one-row, one-partition example holds twelve 512 MiB arrays. It"
" starts with 4 GiB and allows 8 GiB, so the first attempt cannot hold all 6 "
"GiB. The retry completes when the runtime and quota can supply enough "
"memory."
msgstr ""
"下面的示例只有一行数据、一个分区，会持有十二个 512 MiB 的数组。起始内存为 4 GiB，上限为 8 GiB，因此第一次尝试无法容纳全部 6 "
"GiB 数据。运行环境和 Quota 能提供足够内存时，扩容后的重试可以完成。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:262
msgid ""
"This example deliberately allocates 6 GiB and triggers an OOM. Run it in a "
"test environment with capacity for an 8 GiB DPE task. Do not run it in Local"
" Debug Mode."
msgstr ""
"这个示例会主动申请 6 GiB 内存并触发 OOM。应在能为单个 DPE 任务分配 8 GiB 的测试环境中运行，不要使用 Local Debug "
"Mode。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:266
msgid ""
"Set the four connection environment variables before running the example. "
"Inside the UDF, DPE provides ``MAXFRAME_SUBSTEP_ATTEMPT`` as the zero-based "
"attempt number. Local Debug Mode does not provide this variable or run "
"elastic-memory retries."
msgstr ""
"运行前需要设置上面的四个连接环境变量。在 UDF 内，DPE 会提供 ``MAXFRAME_SUBSTEP_ATTEMPT``，表示从 0 "
"开始的运行次数。Local Debug 模式不提供这个变量，也不执行弹性内存重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:333
msgid ""
"The UDF keeps twelve 512 MiB arrays in ``buffers`` and writes to every array"
" with ``fill(1)``. This uses real memory. It waits 20 seconds before "
"allocation, five seconds between arrays, and 20 seconds after allocation so "
"that Sensor can sample the growth. ``skip_infer=True`` prevents MaxFrame "
"from calling the UDF on the client to infer its output. Run this example on "
"DPE, without local debug mode."
msgstr ""
"UDF 将 12 个 512 MiB 数组保存在 ``buffers`` 中，并通过 ``fill(1)`` 写入每个数组，实际占用内存。分配前等待 "
"20 秒，每次分配间隔 5 秒，分配完成后再保留 20 秒，便于 Sensor 采样观察内存增长。``skip_infer=True`` 可避免 "
"MaxFrame 为推断结果类型而在客户端调用 UDF。这个示例需要在 DPE 上运行，不使用 Local Debug 模式。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:340
msgid ""
"The ``option_context`` block disables automatic local execution for this "
"submission. This keeps the small sample on DPE, where elastic retries run. "
"The verified run returned:"
msgstr "``option_context`` 代码块关闭了这次提交的自动本地执行，确保这个小样本在 DPE 上运行，才能触发弹性重试。本次实际运行的结果如下："

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:349
msgid ""
"The task detail recorded the following attempts for SubStep "
"``c1e52ae8127f_0``. Attempt numbers start at zero. The memory column lists "
"the configured allocation for each attempt."
msgstr "任务详情记录了 SubStep ``c1e52ae8127f_0`` 的以下两次运行。运行次数从 0 开始计数，内存列表示每次运行对应的配置值。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:358
msgid "Configured memory"
msgstr "配置内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:359
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:360
msgid "StdOut"
msgstr "StdOut"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:361
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:363
msgid "``FAILED``"
msgstr "``FAILED``"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:364
msgid "``attempt=0, allocating 6 GiB``; no allocation-complete message."
msgstr "``attempt=0, allocating 6 GiB``；没有打印分配完成的消息。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:365
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:367
msgid "``TERMINATED``"
msgstr "``TERMINATED``"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:368
msgid "``attempt=1, allocating 6 GiB`` followed by ``attempt=1, allocated_gib=6``."
msgstr "先打印 ``attempt=1, allocating 6 GiB``，随后打印 ``attempt=1, allocated_gib=6``。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:371
msgid ""
"The successful row has ``[2.0x memory]`` and **Rerun** ``1``. Together with "
"the failed attempt and the returned result, these verify the expansion from "
"4 GiB to 8 GiB. The attempt number alone does not identify an OOM retry."
msgstr ""
"成功任务显示 ``[2.0x memory]``，**Rerun** 为 ``1``。结合第一次失败的记录和最终返回结果，可以确认任务从 4 GiB "
"扩容到了 8 GiB。单看尝试编号，不能判断是否因 OOM 重试。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:375
msgid ""
"One DataFrameApplyChunk task with doubled memory and Rerun 1 in the user "
"Logview"
msgstr "用户版 Logview 中，单个 DataFrameApplyChunk 任务显示内存翻倍，Rerun 为 1"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:375
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/elastic_memory/logview-memory-label.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/elastic_memory/logview-memory-label.jpg\n"
"   :alt: 用户版 Logview 中，单个 DataFrameApplyChunk 任务显示内存翻倍，Rerun 为 1"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:379
msgid ""
"The image combines the task and retry columns from the same row. The gap "
"marks omitted columns."
msgstr "图中保留了同一行的任务信息和重试次数，空隙处省略了中间的其他列。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:383
msgid "Choose the starting memory and limit"
msgstr "选择起始内存和上限"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:385
msgid ""
"Open **Sensor** on the UDF task's row. Under **Resource Basic Metrics**, "
"compare ``mem_usage`` with ``mem_plan``. **Mem Metrics** shows ``mem_rss`` "
"and ``mem_cache`` separately. Check the task ID and time range so the curve "
"matches the attempt under investigation. See :ref:`logview_fuxi_sensor` for "
"metric meanings and the MCSQL entry point."
msgstr ""
"打开 UDF 任务所在行的 **Sensor**，在 **Resource Basic Metrics** 中对比 ``mem_usage`` 和 "
"``mem_plan``。**Mem Metrics** 会分别显示 ``mem_rss`` 和 ``mem_cache``。同时核对任务 ID "
"和时间范围，确保曲线对应正在排查的那次尝试。指标含义和 MCSQL 的查看入口见 :ref:`logview_fuxi_sensor`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:391
msgid ""
"The following charts show the two attempts of this example in the user "
"Logview. The first is from the failed attempt, configured with 4 GiB. Its "
"last sample precedes the failure by about 12 seconds, so it does not show "
"memory usage at the moment of failure."
msgstr ""
"下面两张图来自本示例的用户版 Logview。第一张对应配置为 4 GiB 的首次运行。最后一个采样点比失败时间早约 12 "
"秒，因此没有记录到失败瞬间的内存用量。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:396
msgid ""
"Sensor formats axis labels automatically, including MB and GB labels on the "
"same chart. Read each value together with its unit. The screenshots retain "
"the units displayed by Sensor; the configuration examples use GiB."
msgstr ""
"Sensor 会自动格式化坐标轴刻度，同一张图中可能同时出现 MB 和 GB。读取数值时需要一起看单位。截图保留了 Sensor "
"实际显示的单位，文中的配置示例使用 GiB。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:400
msgid "User Logview Sensor samples before the first attempt failed"
msgstr "用户版 Logview Sensor 中首次运行失败前的内存采样"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:400
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/elastic_memory/sensor-memory-initial.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/elastic_memory/sensor-memory-initial.jpg"
"\n"
"   :alt: 用户版 Logview Sensor 中首次运行失败前的内存采样"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:404
msgid ""
"The second chart is from the successful retry, configured with 8 GiB. Usage "
"rises as the arrays are allocated, then levels off during the 20-second "
"hold. The ``[2.0x memory]`` label reports an allocation ratio; it is not a "
"measured memory peak."
msgstr ""
"第二张对应配置为 8 GiB 的成功重试。内存用量随数组分配逐渐上升，在最后保留数组的 20 秒内保持平稳。``[2.0x memory]`` "
"表示内存分配倍数，不是实测峰值。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:409
msgid ""
"User Logview Sensor showing memory usage and requested memory for the "
"successful retry"
msgstr "用户版 Logview Sensor 中成功重试的实际内存用量和申请内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:409
msgid ".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/elastic_memory/sensor-memory.jpg"
msgstr ""
".. image:: ../../_static/user_guide/elastic_memory/sensor-memory.jpg\n"
"   :alt: 用户版 Logview Sensor 中成功重试的实际内存用量和申请内存"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:413
msgid ""
"Use representative inputs, including the largest payloads or groups. Choose "
"starting memory that covers normal tasks, then leave room for input, models,"
" intermediate objects, and output. Use larger successful tasks to estimate "
"the limit, within the available quota. A killed process's final sample can "
"miss its peak, so do not size the limit from that sample alone."
msgstr ""
"选择有代表性的输入，也要包含最大的 payload "
"或分组。起始内存应能覆盖普通任务，并为输入、模型、临时对象和输出留出空间。再参考较大任务成功运行时的用量，在可用 Quota "
"范围内确定上限。进程被终止前的最后一个采样点可能没有记录到峰值，不能只凭这个值设置上限。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:419
msgid ""
"For example, suppose measurements across representative inputs show a 95th-"
"percentile task peak of 3 GiB and a largest successful task peak of 6 GiB. "
"Starting at 4 GiB with an 8 GiB limit leaves 1 GiB and 2 GiB of headroom, "
"respectively. These are trial settings for that workload, not a fixed "
"multiplier for every UDF. Validate them with larger inputs and the actual "
"runtime before using them for a full job."
msgstr ""
"例如，假设用有代表性的输入测得：95% 的任务峰值不超过 3 GiB，最大的成功任务峰值为 6 GiB。这种情况下，可以先设初始内存 4 GiB、上限 "
"8 GiB，分别留出 1 GiB 和 2 GiB 余量。这只是该工作负载的起始选值，并不是所有 UDF "
"都适用的固定倍数；正式运行前，还需要用更大的输入和实际运行环境验证。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:426
msgid ""
"With the default limit of 12 GiB per CPU, this 4-to-8 GiB example can keep "
"one CPU. A 16 GiB allocation needs at least ``ceil(16 / 12) = 2`` CPUs. Both"
" the starting allocation and retry limit must fit the available quota. See "
":ref:`udf_tuning_resources`."
msgstr ""
"按默认每个 CPU 最多配置 12 GiB 内存计算，4 GiB 扩到 8 GiB 时可以保持 1 个 CPU；分配 16 GiB 时，至少需要 "
"``ceil(16 / 12) = 2`` 个 CPU。初始资源和重试上限都需要在 Quota 可提供的范围内，具体见 "
":ref:`udf_tuning_resources`。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:431
msgid ""
"The deliberate OOM example above always holds 6 GiB of arrays. For a "
"workload where every task needs that much memory, start with a measured "
"sufficient allocation, such as 8 GiB for the verified run, instead of making"
" every task fail once at 4 GiB."
msgstr ""
"上面的故意 OOM 示例固定持有 6 GiB 数组。如果实际作业中每个任务都需要这么多内存，应直接设置经测量足够的初始内存，例如这次验证使用的 8 "
"GiB，避免每个任务先在 4 GiB 下失败一次。"

#: ../../../../../../../maxframe/docs/source/user_guide/udf/elastic_memory.rst:436
msgid ""
"If most tasks need a retry, raise the starting memory or reduce their input."
" If only a few keep failing at the limit, inspect those inputs for skew or a"
" memory leak before increasing the limit again. Repeated OOM failures at the"
" limit also warrant checking whether smaller chunks or batches reduce the "
"peak; see :ref:`udf_tuning`. A missing Sensor chart does not establish low "
"memory use."
msgstr ""
"如果大多数任务都需要重试，应提高初始内存或减少任务输入。如果只有少数任务持续在上限处失败，先检查输入是否倾斜、函数是否泄漏内存，再决定是否继续提高上限。反复在上限处"
" OOM 时，也需要检查减小 chunk 或 batch 能否降低峰值，具体见 :ref:`udf_tuning`。没有 Sensor "
"曲线并不代表内存占用低。"
